{"lyrics":"[00:04.20]Oh-oh, oh-oh, oh-oh-oh-oh\n[00:10.54](Hollywood J)\n[00:11.48]Yeah, \"How you feel?\" Bitch, I'm great\n[00:14.84]Eating good, steak, shrimp on my plate\n[00:17.72]From the hood, wait, get out my face\n[00:20.38]If you out of line, I'll put you in your place\n[00:23.68]Woke up fiending for the lean, so I hit the plug\n[00:26.64]He got everything I need, all exotic drugs\n[00:29.16]I'm runnin' up a check, so I'm not runnin' out of funds\n[00:32.38]These niggas try to fight, I guess they runnin' out of guns\n[00:34.98]She all in my cup, red lean, new Glock, red beam (She all in my cup, red lean, new Glock, red beam)\n[00:38.86]Your bitch do the whole damn team (Your bitch do the whole damn team)\n[00:42.08]She all in my cup, red lean, new Glock, red beam (She all in my cup, red lean, new Glock, red beam)\n[00:45.88]Your bitch do the whole damn team (Your bitch do the whole damn team)\n[00:48.04]Tell me how you want it, I'ma throw twenties, I'ma throw hundreds when I'm up in Follies\n[00:52.20]Baby, your nigga a lame, yeah, that nigga folly, on Twitter, he just followed me\n[00:56.66]While you over here swallowing, can you taste the irony?\n[00:59.34]I'm John Cena with this shit, you niggas ain't see it comin'\n[01:02.38]Before I pop a Perc, I pray to God that I don't vomit\n[01:05.36]I put my soul into this shit, I swear it's all or nothing\n[01:08.46]Sippin' real slime, this ain't Robitussin\n[01:11.46]Had a fun time, almost flat lined (Ooh-ooh-ooh)\n[01:14.62]Was thinking if I take the right drugs, I might die\n[01:17.38]Begging for the lean, I'm a high guy (Ooh-ooh-ooh)\n[01:20.26]Off-White with the double G, I'm a fly guy (Ooh)\n[01:23.06]Woke up fiending for the lean, so I hit the plug\n[01:25.90]He got everything I need, all exotic drugs\n[01:28.44]I'm runnin' up a check, so I'm not runnin' out of funds\n[01:31.64]These niggas try to fight, I guess they runnin' out of guns\n[01:34.78]She all in my cup, red lean, new Glock, red beam (She all 